1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:14,000
We started out in silence, two hearts that did not know
我們起初在沉默中相遇，兩顆心尚未彼此靠近

2
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:21,000
But through the grace of heaven, we watched a promise grow
但在天父的恩典中，我們看見承諾漸漸萌芽

3
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:28,000
Then winter brought its shadows, and sorrow filled the space
後來寒冬帶來陰影，悲傷充盈了我們的世界

4
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:36,000
We lost our precious angels, but never lost our faith
我們失去了珍貴的兩個小天使，卻從未失去信仰

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Oh sweet Eliana, you are the light
親愛的 Eliana，妳是我們的光明

6
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:48,000
The answered prayer of our endless night
是我們漫長黑夜裡應驗的祈禱

7
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:54,000
God gave us a miracle and made us whole
上帝賜予我們奇蹟，讓我們的家趨於完整

8
00:00:54,500 --> 00:01:00,000
The beautiful anchor of our soul
妳是我們靈魂深處美麗的錨

9
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:06,000
Together forever in this sacred love
在這神聖的愛裡，我們永遠相依

10
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:12,000
Our beautiful angel from above
來自天上的美麗天使

11
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:18,000
Through every season and every year
無論四季更疊、歲月流轉

12
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:25,000
We will always keep you near
我們永遠將妳珍藏在身旁

13
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:33,000
I saw the tears you carried, I felt the broken dreams
我曾看見你承載的眼淚，感受到夢想破滅的痛

14
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:40,000
But hand in hand we stood there, flowing in His healing streams
但我們手牽手站立，浸潤在祂醫治的溪流中

15
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:47,000
Now in this bright white haven, where pastels gently bloom
如今在這純白的避風港，柔和的花朵靜靜盛開

16
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:54,000
Our hearts are filled with wonders, and love is made anew
我們的內心充滿驚奇，愛重新煥發光彩

17
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:00,000
From every scar a beauty was born
每一個傷痕中，都孕育出了美好

18
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:06,000
A brand new day is starting to dawn
全新的一天正迎來黎明

19
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:12,000
We stand in white and we lift you high
我們身著白衣，將妳高高舉起

20
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:18,500
Our beautiful miracle under the sky
這片天空下，我們最美麗的奇蹟

21
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:24,000
Oh sweet Eliana, you are the light
親愛的 Eliana，妳是我們的光明

22
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:29,500
The answered prayer of our endless night
是我們漫長黑夜裡應驗的祈禱

23
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:35,000
God gave us a miracle and made us whole
上帝賜予我們奇蹟，讓我們的家趨於完整

24
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:40,500
The beautiful anchor of our soul
妳是我們靈魂深處美麗的錨

25
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:46,000
In our hearts you will forever shine
在我們心中，妳將永遠璀璨耀眼

26
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:51,500
You brought us back to life again
妳讓我們的生命重新煥發光芒

27
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:58,000
Our beautiful Eliana, Amen.
我們美麗的 Eliana，阿們。